'''Egypt''' is the 20th stage in [[Empire of Cats]]. Upon completion in Chapter 1, [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Lizard Cat]] and [[Cats in a Box (Special Cat)|Cats in a Box]] will be available to unlock from the [[Upgrade Menu]].

