==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 1~10 seconds<sup>30f~300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 1~10 seconds<sup>30f~300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 1~10 seconds<sup>30f~300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Baa Baa]]s spawn after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>, delay 1~10 seconds<sup>30f~300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Pigge]]s spawn after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>, delay 60~120 seconds<sup>1,800f~3,600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Hippoe]]s spawn after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>, delay 60~120 seconds<sup>1,800f~3,600f</sup>.
*4 [[Gory|Gories]] spawn after 133.33 seconds<sup>4,000f</sup>, delay 60~120 seconds<sup>1,800f~3,600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Start the battle by upgrading the [[Worker Cat]]. When the enemies come near the [[Cat Base]], spawn a few meatshields and [[Axe Cat (Normal Cat)|Axe Cats]]; they will be your stallers. Meanwhile, upgrade your Worker Cat to max level. When the Baa Baas and Pigge appear, let them progress towards your base. When they are close enough, start sending out meatshields, Axe Cats, [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Gross Cats]], and [[Bird Cat (Normal Cat)|Bird Cats]]. If you want to speed things up, use [[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Cow Cat]] and [[Fish Cat (Normal Cat)|Fish Cat]].

