==Trivia==
*In the [[Nyanko Daisensou|Japanese version]], this stage takes place in '''Kyoto Prefecture'''.
*Kyoto Prefecture's base is a [[wikipedia:Maiko|''maiko'']] (apprentice geisha) in front of [[wikipedia:Kinkaku-ji|Kinkaku-ji]], a Zen Buddhist temple and popular tourist attraction.
**Kyoto Prefecture's base also appears in the [[Japan (Empire of Cats)|Japan]] stage of the [[The Battle Cats|English version]] and "[[In JAPAN (Crazed Moneko)|in JAPAN]]" in [[Crazed Moneko]]; making it one of the few bases from the Japanese version of [[Empire of Cats]] to appear at all in BCEN.

